# Every text file is LF in the repository and in every checkout. Without
# this, Windows checkouts (core.autocrlf=true) produced CRLF files that the
# formatter (oxfmt, via `ultracite check`) reported as hundreds of spurious
# format errors (forensic audit F-29).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.woff2 binary
